    <p>2015 Highway Bill (FAST ACT)</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Contains provisions dealing with Energy Security and requires the Secretary of the US Department of Energy to Study and Report to Congress. The Report will assess the US energy security posture, identify metrics for evaluating energy-related actions with respect to their effects on energy security, and include an <span data-field="implementation_strategy">{{ implementation_strategy }}</span> strategy for ensuring that metrics are applied consistently throughout government.</li>
